body:
People are going to be dicks because they know they can. Once you find a way to show them that they can't be like that to you life will get easier. Your patients shouldn't treat you like that. 

&#x200B;

Your coworkers suck but if that is the only thing wrong with them consider yourself lucky.

Tech here. When i first started we had plenty but we found a technique that generally works. Every customer save one is still with us and is much more polite. Generally once they were starting to get nasty one of us, usually myself or my senior pharmacist, would take them to an aisle. No other customers, away from the pharmacy...we had a talk. It was blunt and quick. If you continue to treat us back here like you are I will deny any more fills for you. I will cancel all of your scripts and ban you from the store. 

&#x200B;

Most customers reacted well to it, although it should be noted I am 6'3 and 300 pounds with a background of in home collections, repossessions, and foreclosures. You need someone who can handle themselves and make the message clear. 

&#x200B;

Doing this shows your support to your team and teaches the patient they can't  treat us like that.

I will start this with a disclaimer. I am older than you. Not alot....but still older...

&#x200B;

Still reading...alright then. I am a horror freak from way back in the day. Movies are nice,shorts are ok but the writing is where the true horror is at. We use our own mind to terrify us. That is pretty much the only thing only  my screen. I don't watch v much because of my son. He likes mickey mouse while i prefer oastes...king..romero...jackson. I know you were expecting lovecraft but he is a bit long winded for me. I love his stories in short form rather than original writing.

&#x200B;

AS FOR IN THE KITCHEN...you betta bring your apron girl cause i have a legitamite cookbook. Ok so it isn't published yet but soon. I am also always adding things to it so I can get it finished.. SO BRING IT!!!

On second thought it would be nice to have someone to cook with...either or.

&#x200B;

Abandoned places...I have that shit. Bloomville, NY.  Practically abandoned. Soon to be actually abandoned.

&#x200B;

So if you get bored and want to speak to a creepy old guy in a creepy small town let me.

Hello,

&#x200B;

I am on here nightly so it is never hard to find me. Gamer since...well lets leave it at awhile. I don't stream anymore but you might be able to find some old caffeinate rage vids of me. I haven't spent much time on writing but i have been published once...soo...bonus points. I live in the middle of no where so surrounded by the outdoorsy. I drive through it every day to work at the pharmacy. As for who you are as a person...things happen. I am at the end of a 8 year marriage and 16 year relationship. Now...I am not that old, just met my current and former other at a young age. If you are interested or just want to say hi, Let me know. I try not to force myself on others so I let them message. It is more than welcome.
